#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_SYSTEM_000_302:1"
msgid "When you are satisfied with the allotment of attributes, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Allocate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to complete the process."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 再調整を行う場合は、専用の素材が必要となりますので、<br>よく考えながら、パラメータを強化していきましょう。
#. de: Überlege dir deine Änderungen sorgfältig, denn jede Neuverteilung kostet dich wieder <noun-de Item 5 32959 2 4 1>.
#. fr: Chaque amélioration requiert de nouvelles ressources. Prenez le temps de bien réfléchir avant de confirmer vos choix.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_SYSTEM_000_303:1"
msgid "Choose carefully, as redistribution of attributes will require the procurement of additional materials."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ピピピ……ピピ……<br>記憶エーテル、解析、選別……抽出…………。
#. de: \<biep> Matrize wird eingelesen ... Erinnerungen werden vorbereitet ...
#. fr: Bip bip... Analyse de l'éther... Bip bip... Tri des matériaux... Bip bip... Extraction en cours...
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_070:1"
msgid "\\<blip> \\<blip> Scanning registry... Readying memories for extraction..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 武器へのコーティング……及び、記憶定着作業を開始！
#. de: \<blip> Ätherisolierende Beschichtung wird erneuert ...
#. fr: Bip bip... Pose du revêtement... Bip bip... Incor<shy>por<shy>ation des souvenirs...
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_071:1"
msgid "\\<blip> Applying aetheroinsulation coating...<br>\\<blip> \\<blip> Initiating aetheric memory infusion..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: よっしゃ、無事に加工作業が終わったようだな。<br>完成した武器を見せてくれや！！
#. de: Na, wer sagt's denn! Es funktioniert! Das Ei hat's wirklich drauf.
#. fr: Nous y voilà, les p'tits gars<nbsp>! Le système de mémorisation a terminé sa part du boulot. <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, montre-nous un peu cette arme dotée de son joli revêtement<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_072:1"
msgid "Well, I'll be damned. It worked!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 玉っころも、やるじゃねえか！<br>我らが英雄に相応しい武器が仕上がったぜ……！<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」、完成だ！
#. de: Und nun präsentiere ich der Welt: <sheet Item $n1 9>!
#. fr: La vache, c'est qu'elle est balèze, cette grosse bouboule<nbsp>! Essaie de pas abîmer <noun-fr Item 4 $n1 1 1> trop vite, hé hé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>'er</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 20 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>'er</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 30 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>'er</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 38 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_080:1"
msgid "I'll give the Allagan ball o' bolts credit─any smith worth their hammer'd be proud of a weapon as fine as this. I'll call <if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>'er</if></if></if> <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 玉っころも、やるじゃねえか！<br>我らが英雄に相応しい武器が仕上がったぜ……！<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」、完成だ！
#. de: Und nun präsentiere ich der Welt: <sheet Item $n1 9>!
#. fr: La vache, c'est qu'elle est balèze, cette grosse bouboule<nbsp>! Tiens, prends <noun-fr Item 4 $n1 1 1>, et essaie de pas l'abîmer trop vite, hé hé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_081:1"
msgid "I'll give the Allagan ball o' bolts credit─any smith worth their hammer'd be proud of a weapon as fine as this. I'll call 'er <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: さらに、「<sheet Item $n1 0>」もなぁ！
#. de: Und sein treuer Kumpan: <sheet Item $n1 9>!
#. fr: Et voilà <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1> qui va avec<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_082:1"
msgid "And what better to partner 'er with than <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: よし、望んだとおりの効果を発揮してやがる。<br>今後も、調整はこの玉っころに任せれば大丈夫そうだな。
#. de: Und wenn irgendwas nicht stimmt mit deiner neuen Waffe, beschwer dich bei dem sprechenden Ei.
#. fr: En tant que meilleur forgeron d'Éorzéa et d'ailleurs, je dois admettre que cet engin fait le travail presque aussi bien que moi. Je te donne ma bénédiction pour continuer à utiliser ses services<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 19)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 19 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 20 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 30 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 38 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_100:1"
msgid "'Course if somethin' ain't right with <if ($gn68 == 19)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if></if>, tell it to the node, not me."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ピ、ピ……再調整にあたっての、注意事項あり。<br>記憶エーテルを定着させ直すため、コーティング作業から、<br>再度行う必要が、あります……。
#. de: \<biep> Achtung. \<biep> Achtung.<br>Weitere Anpassungen erfordern erneute Beschichtung.
#. fr: Bip bip... Votre attention, s'il vous plaît. Toute nouvelle incor<shy>por<shy>ation de souvenirs sur une arme nécessite l'apport de la quantité adéquate du matériau approprié pour le revêtement.
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_101:1"
msgid "\\<blip> Warning. \\<blip> Warning.<br>Subsequent memory infusions require reapplication of aetheroinsulation coating."
msgstr ""

#. ja: となると、再調整を行いたいときは、<br>改めて、霊珪土を集め直す必要がありそうですね。
#. de: Aha. Für jede Anpassung ist also wieder Seelenerde nötig. Interessant.
#. fr: Traduction<nbsp>: vous aurez à nouveau besoin d'argile colloïdale si vous voulez améliorer une autre arme de la résistance, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>.
#. speaker: ZLATAN
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_ZLATAN_000_102:1"
msgid "Meaning Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split> would need to acquire more siltstone."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ピピ、ピ……ポーーン！<br>そこで、オカイドク情報が、ございます！！
#. de: (-Rowenas Stimme-)\<rausch> ... Und Seelenerde kann nun zum Sonderpreis bei mir im Haus der Wunder erworben werden!
#. fr: Bip bip... BIIIIP<nbsp>!! À ce sujet, n'oubliez pas la grande promotion en cours à la maison des splendeurs de Rowena<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_103:1"
msgid "And there is no better place to procure said siltstone than Rowena's House of Splendors!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 再調整を行う際は、霊珪土をもとに、<br>特定の配合を施した「<sheet Item 32960 0>」がオススメです！
#. de: (-Rowenas Stimme-)Jawohl, die Regale sind gefüllt mit <sheet Item 32960 9> von allerbester Qualität. Besuchen Sie das Haus der Wunder oder eine seiner Außenstellen und überzeugen Sie sich selbst!
#. fr: Fabriquée à base d'argile du même nom, la solution colloïdale est le produit idéal pour modifier votre arme sans avoir besoin de passer des heures interminables sur un champ de bataille<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_104:1"
msgid "Our stalls are stocked with the finest relics, containing high concentrations of aetherial siltstone, which are certain to meet all your weapon forging needs. Visit your nearest House of Splendors representative today, and receive a discount on your first purchase!<br>If quality is what you seek, then come to Mor Dhona and let Mistress Rowena add a touch of splendor to your life."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Item 32960 0>は、各地の「ロウェナ商会」で絶賛取り扱い中！<br>詳細は「追憶システム」まで、お尋ねください！<br>どうぞロウェナ商会をゴヒイキに！　ゴヒイキに！
#. de: (-Rowenas Stimme-)Und wie immer gilt: Das Haus der Wunder übernimmt keine Haftung für den unsachgemäßen oder sachgemäßen Gebrauch seiner Artikel. Einen schönen Tag noch!
#. fr: N'hésitez pas à vous procurer dès maintenant de la solution colloïdale, disponible dans les échoppes officielles de la maison des splendeurs de Rowena<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_105:1"
msgid "This advertisement was brought to you by Rowena's House of Splendors.<br><i>The House of Splendors is not responsible for damages, injury, or painful<br>death incurred through the use, misuse, or inability to use their products.<br>Offer is void in the void where prohibited or not prohibited.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ウッ……この玉っころ、<br>完全にロウェナ商会の下僕になっちまった……。
#. de: Jetzt verfolgt einen diese Blutsaugerin auch schon in allagischen Eiern! Ist man denn nirgendswo vor ihr sicher?
#. fr: Eh ben... Au moins, on sait pour qui roule la grosse bouboule maintenant.
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_106:1"
msgid "Bloody hell... Is nothing safe from that money-grubbin' witch?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: わかるぜ、その気持ち……。<br>気づいた時には、言いなりになる以外の選択肢がないほどに、<br>がんじがらめにされちまうンだ……。
#. de: Na, was soll's. Ich weiß schon, was ich tun kann, um meinen Zorn zu vergessen. Eine kleine Erfrischung wird mich auf andere Gedanken bringen.
#. fr: En même temps, je la comprends... Une fois que Rowena a mis la main sur un bon filon, elle le lâche pas. Je suis bien placé pour le savoir<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_107:1"
msgid "Guess I should count meself fortunate. 'Least I got to keep me name, unlike the rest o' her bloody underlings. \\<sigh> Though I reckon she'll come fer that too afore long..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 無事に調整が完了したようだな。<br>……まあ、この後、再調整をしたくなったときは、<br>例によってロウェナ商会から素材を調達するわけだが。
#. de: Und wenn irgendwas nicht stimmt mit deiner neuen Waffe, beschwer dich bei dem sprechenden Ei.
#. fr: Ton arme est prête, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Pour en modifier les capacités, t'auras qu'à te procurer la solution magique de Rowena.
#. speaker: GEROLT
#. macro: <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 19)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 19 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 20 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 30 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 38 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_GEROLT_000_120:1"
msgid "Remember, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>─if somethin' ain't right with <if ($gn68 == 19)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 20)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 30)>'em<else><if ($gn68 == 38)>'em<else>it</if></if></if></if>, tell it to the node, not me."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ピピ……再調整の際は「<sheet Item 32960 0>」をお持ちください！<br><sheet Item 32960 0>は、各地の「ロウェナ商会」で絶賛取り扱い中！<br>どうぞロウェナ商会をゴヒイキに！　ゴヒイキに！
#. de: \<biep> Weitere Anpassungen erfordern erneute Beschichtung. Bitte besuchen Sie das Haus der Wunder oder eine seiner Außenstellen, um die nötige Seelenerde zu erwerben. \<biep>
#. fr: Bip bip... Amenez vos armes de la résistance au summum de leur efficacité grâce à la solution colloïdale, disponible dans les échoppes officielles de la maison des splendeurs de Rowena<nbsp>! Nous vous attendons avec impatience, vénérables clients<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MEMORIZESYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_MEMORIZESYSTEM_000_121:1"
msgid "\\<blip> Additional aetherial siltstone required for reapplication of aetheroinsulation coating. Artifacts from Rowena's House of Splendors recommended for maximum efficiency. \\<blip> House of Splendors representatives are standing by!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ロウェナ商会との取引なくば、<br>ここまで反攻作戦を行い続けることは不可能でした……。<br>その点は、どれほど感謝しても足りません。
#. de: Immerhin besser, als in fallengespickte Ruinen oder unterirdische Paläste hinabzusteigen, aber ich bin kein großer Anhänger vom Haus der Wunder.
#. fr: Les affaires priment sur tout pour une marchande comme Rowena, mais sans elle, la résistance bozjienne serait pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment encore au point mort. Nous ne pouvons donc que lui être re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sants pour ses services.
#. speaker: ZLATAN
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_ZLATAN_000_122:1"
msgid "Hmm... That would certainly save you from the undue burden of traveling the world over in search of the requisite antiquities. Of course, that is to say nothing of the payment expected in return..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ですが、ロウェナ商会との取引によって、<br>組織の資産を食い潰してしまうことのないよう、<br>今後は、より一層気をつけていかねばなりませんね。
#. de: Man weiß nie, welchen Preis man noch zu zahlen hat.
#. fr: Néanmoins, il ne faudrait pas que notre trésorerie entière se retrouve dans ses coffres-forts... Il va falloir que j'en discute avec Bajsaljen et Marsak...
#. speaker: ZLATAN
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_ZLATAN_000_123:1"
msgid "From what I gather, placing ourselves in their debt, financial or otherwise, would be ill-advised."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 再調整に必要な「<sheet Item 32960 0>」は、<br>レヴナンツトールの「オーリアナ」か、<br>イディルシャイアの「ヒスメナ」から交換できます。
#. de: <capitalize><sheet Item 32960 9></capitalize> kann bei Ariana in Geisterzoll oder Hismena in Frohehalde erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez obtenir <noun-fr Item 1 32960 2 1> auprès d'Auriana au Glas des revenants, ainsi que de Hismena à Idyllée.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/040/LucKsa253_04040:TEXT_LUCKSA253_04040_SYSTEM_000_124:1"
msgid "Aetherial sealant can be obtained from Auriana at Revenant's Toll or Hismena at Idyllshire."
msgstr ""
